{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797830/extras/52d84c5a482978e3507b1fbf91c7a556.avif?t=1761066041\" width=1280 height=360 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About this game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Egglings\u00a0</strong>is a beautifully hand-crafted pixel-art creature collector. From birds and amphibians to dinosaurs and dragons, each egg holds a surprise waiting to hatch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your collection as you discover and nurture a wide range of unique Egglings. Place your hatched companions - <i>called egglings</i> <i>-\u00a0</i>in the shelter to earn valuable bonuses, or release them into the wild to unlock new rewards. <strong>Rare golden</strong> variants await the most dedicated collectors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797830/extras/0aa28b41adb92a4c910f830951264e0b.poster.avif?t=1761066041\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797830/extras/0aa28b41adb92a4c910f830951264e0b.webm?t=1761066041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797830/extras/0aa28b41adb92a4c910f830951264e0b.mp4?t=1761066041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short and satisfying</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hatch and collect over 40 unique Egglings</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover rare golden variants with exclusive passive bonuses</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete quests</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decide to sell, release or sheleter you hatched egglings</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797830/extras/051d58967343c63414aa83dddb90d8c7.poster.avif?t=1761066041\" width=250 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797830/extras/051d58967343c63414aa83dddb90d8c7.webm?t=1761066041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Me</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hi, I'm Maurice!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>I currently live in Germany and develop games in my free time.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>I started working on Egglings earlier this year,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>and it\u2019s my first commercial project.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>As a solo developer, I created and programmed all the assets myself.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>I hope you enjoy Egglings!</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Shiny Duck","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3797830/2911c33baa380e677055e8fb93cdc099fa204037.jpg"},{"name":"Shiny Chick","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3797830/bf16aca3c9c11c4c7a87c7f56ed94ddb67b8338d.jpg"},{"name":"Shiny Pigeon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3797830/5048ee4ae494d81361c4c353addaf733407611b9.jpg"},{"name":"Shiny Frog","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3797830/23202d9d09697d4b08a208708cba10fbc55a70e6.jpg"},{"name":"Shiny Axolotl","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3797830/9295b8dcdd3fe2f40a633212ebb9afaa0398f30f.jpg"},{"name":"Shiny Tadpole","pat